### 3. Gene Coordinate Cache

#### [NEW] [make_realistic_cache.R](file:///h:/omicsflow_test/make_realistic_cache.R)

Creates `realistic_cache.rds` — a gene coordinate cache matching the gene symbols used in the CNV data, so the CNV module can map segments → genes without downloading from Ensembl.

