## Verification Plan

### Automated Tests
1. Run `Rscript generate_realistic_cohort.R` — verify all 7 files created
2. Run `Rscript run_realistic_validation.R` — verify all modules pass
3. Check console output for the final PASS/FAIL report

### Manual Verification
- Inspect `results/realistic_validation/validation_report.txt` for the full summary
- Review QC plots in each output directory to confirm subtype separation is visible
